abstract: >-
  Versioned reproducibility material for the manuscript Evidence Before Economic
  Attribution: A Utility-Planning Audit Framework for Hatta and Wivenhoe Pumped
  Storage. Includes compact Hatta accounting and Wivenhoe market-observation
  tables and the locked 48-case response-shape audit, without redistribution
  of complete upstream raw datasets or claims of empirical E4 validation.
